<title>JAPAN: DKB's Sugita says bank's system of checks failed.</title>
<headline>DKB's Sugita says bank's system of checks failed.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd's (DKB) newly nominated president Katsuyuki Sugita said on Tuesday that the bank's system of checks failed to stop a scandal from tarnishing the bank.</p>
</text>
